SUMMARY:DRUNKEN DISNEY SINGALONG
DESCRIPTION:Sing along with slightly inebriated renditions of your favorite Disney songs!\nTIP YOUR PERFORMERS!!\nVenmo: @Clifford-Bond   \n\nErin McCracken is an actress\, singer\, songwriter\, and dirty martini aficionado. No stranger to Disney music as she performed on the Disney Magic Cruise Ship and is real life friends with the Fairy Godmother! From Oklahoma City to New York City to Nashville\, Erin has made a career performing in musicals\, concerts\, cabarets & cruises. You can find her slingin’ and singin’ every Monday here at Sid Gold’s! Follow her on IG @erinmccracken21 \nAlex Pineiro has performed for many companies across the country including Arizona Broadway Theatre\, The Land of Oz Theme Park\, Nashville Rep\, Nashville Children’s Theatre\, and Chaffin’s Barn Dinner Theatre. He wants to thank you for supporting live\, local performances and he hopes you enjoy the show! Follow him on IG @alexpineiroactor \nDaniel Bissell was born (not on a mountaintop) in Tennessee. Nashville stages over the years have seen him perform musical theatre\, standup comedy\, improv\, karaoke DJing\, puppeteering\, cover-banding and whatever else strikes his fancy. (He was even in a death metal group called Key To The Downfall!) His father played trombone in the Disneyland Band for 30+ years so this music is second nature and such a joy to celebrate with all of you! Peace & Love. \nCliff Bond (piano) hails from Boston\, MA\, where he graduated from Berklee College of Music\, studying piano and jazz composition.  Before moving to Nashville\, he worked as a music director for theatre companies in Austin\, TX.  He also spent a very long nine months performing piano on Cruise ships. Cliff currently works as the Director of Music for Quaver Ed\, where he enriches the lives of millions by producing kids songs.
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/drunken-disney-singalong-11-2-3-6/
LOCATION:Sid Gold’s Request Room Nashville\, 3245 Gallatin Pike\, Nashville\, TN\, 37216\, United States
CATEGORIES:Nashville Events
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://sidgolds.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/04/2024-disney-graphic.png
END:VEVENT
