SUMMARY:Piano Karaoke with Felix Pages
DESCRIPTION:How it works:\nTip Felix!\nCheck out his song list!\nMake a Request\n\nDMV-born multi-instrumentalist\, singer\, and songwriter. Piano is my home base\, but I also play guitar\, bass\, drums\, and mandolin.  (Yeah\, I know.  It’s annoying).   I’ve been obsessed with music since I could walk\, with my earliest known performance being violently kicking my legs to “Sweet Home Alabama” while in a high chair.\nIf you request “Sweet Home Alabama” tonight\, it may just happen again.
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-22-2-2-13/
