SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/Jean St. Lazarus
DESCRIPTION:MAKE A REQUEST!\nCheck out Jean’s SONG LIST\nTIP YOUR PIANIST! Venmo: @jeansaintlazarus \nJean Saint Lazarus (fka Alyssa Lazar) is a piano-influenced pop/rock singer/ songwriter originally from Scranton\, PA. Jean began singing at the age of four\, and playing gigs throughout her hometown weekly by the age of fourteen\, bringing her to her ultimate musical influences of Elton John\, Queen\, Lady Gaga\, and Billy Joel. Fueled by the passion and power of classic rock music\, Jean brings a 70’s-esque nostalgia to today’s sound. She was a member of Team Chance on season 23 of The Voice. IG: @imalyssalazar
URL:https://sidgolds.com/event/piano-karaoke-w-jean-st-lazarus-4/2026-05-08/
