SUMMARY:PIANO KARAOKE w/Anna Lee Palmer
DESCRIPTION:Check out Anna Lee’s SONGLIST\nMAKE A REQUEST HERE!\nTIP YOUR PIANIST! Venmo: @AnnaLee-Palmer  CashApp: $nashvillethenandnow \nAnna Lee Palmer is a classically and commercially trained pianist from Cedar Lake\, AL. She has been doing live performances for 12 years now and moved to Nashville in 2019 to pursue a career in songwriting. From ABBA to Zac Brown Band\, Anna Lee is sure to cover all your go-to “scream sing in the car” songs. IG: @annaleeeeeeeeeeeeeee
